  "dct_description_sm": [
    "<span style='text-indent:0px; text-decoration-style:initial; text-decoration-color:initial; display:inline !important;'>\n\n<div>The boundaries of Minor Urban Centres are defined by the municipality in an approved official plan and/or secondary plan which are not in conflict with the Niagara Escarpment Plan and are listed in Part 1 of the Niagara Escarpment Plan.</div>\n\n<div><br /> </div>\n\n<div><strong>Additional Documentation</strong></div>\n\n<div><ul>\n<li><a href='https://www.publicdocs.mnr.gov.on.ca/mirb/Niagara%20Escarpment%20Minor%20Urban%20Centre%20-%20Data%20Description.pdf' target='_blank' rel='nofollow ugc noopener noreferrer'>Niagara Escarpment Minor Urban Centre - Data Description (PDF)</a><br /></li>\n<li><a href='https://www.publicdocs.mnr.gov.on.ca/mirb/Niagara%20Escarpment%20Minor%20Urban%20Centre%20-%20Documentation.docx' target='_blank' rel='nofollow ugc noopener noreferrer'>Niagara Escarpment Minor Urban Centre - Documentation (Word)</a><br /></li>\n\n</ul></div>\n\n\n\n<div><br /></div>\n\n<div><strong>Status</strong><br /></div>\n\n<div>On going: Data is continually being updated <br /></div>\n\n<div><br /></div>\n\n<div><strong>Maintenance and Update Frequency</strong><br /></div>\n\n<div>As needed: Data is updated as deemed necessary <br /></div>\n\n<div><br /></div>\n\n<div><strong>Contact</strong><br /></div>\n\n<div>Kun Xu, Niagara Escarpment Commission,<a href='mailto:Kun.Xu@ontario.ca' target='_blank' rel='nofollow ugc noopener noreferrer'> \n Kun.Xu@ontario.ca</a></div></span>"
